  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "C"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "$E_{\\text {cell }}^{0}=\\frac{2.303 \\mathrm{RT}}{\\mathrm{nF}} \\log \\mathrm{K}_{\\mathrm{C}}$ or $\\mathrm{E}_{\\text {cell }}^{0}=\\frac{0.059 \\mathrm{~V}}{\\mathrm{n}} \\log \\mathrm{K}_{\\mathrm{C}}$\r\n\r\n$$\r\n\r\n=\\frac{0.059 \\mathrm{~V}}{2} \\log 10^{16}=0.4736 \\mathrm{~V}\r\n\r\n$$"
